{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星林心如近日遭無端造謠。</p><p>一名自稱入行3年的化妝師在社交網發文，指控「林X如」私下脾氣暴躁，曾因妝容弄花就失控罵「白癡」、「爛泥扶不上牆」等惡毒字眼。</p><p>不料貼文隨即遭爆錯字連篇，更有資深攝影師與前經理人出面打臉，指出林心如長年都有專屬梳化</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.170791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T08:01:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.418600+00:00","content_hash":"5653e1221323e649cdce2dee7d08a2db78304322f5bf70097ee884abcd7f4385","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}